## What was not reached

No learned method was run, so this does not establish that exact search wins the interval; it establishes the comparator the learned method must beat. No repeated timing trials or confidence intervals were run. The `SEALED` best-improvement control contains the disclosed OS-scheduling outlier, so its raw mean is not a clean algorithmic runtime estimate. The joint search was not redesigned: it retains the archived physically-best-alternative prerequisite and bounded mechanism catalogue, with only deadline-aware batching. World-tape construction was not charged per decision because the standing harness defines the immutable tape as the decision input; all decision-local feature and candidate construction was charged. No sealed file or frozen manifest was modified.
