/home/sat/mcrl-v025-codex-ws-stagec/V025-STAGES-6-8-SPEC-v1-DRAFT-2026-09-08.md:10:- **A2 / I_coordinator:** global nominal geometry and beam-specific cross gains; every user's legal set; previous committed profile; proposal a0; bounded complete-profile catalogue C; nominal model M; and, for every profile, joint load, coupled powers, interference, activation, service, bits, energy, and continuation. Realised fading is unavailable and future TLE access is limited to the declared forecast horizon. Coordinator wall budget is 10 s.
