/home/sat/mcrl-v025-strategic-astra-ws/ADJUDICATION-ASTRA-2026-09-10.md:11:**Q1. Wall 1 establishes a failed fitted head, not an information ceiling.**
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-strategic-astra-ws/ADJUDICATION-ASTRA-2026-09-10.md:25:The target provenance has limits even in this improved diagnostic: it uses the declared helper with a nearest-eligible reference and boundary index 0, and checks path-consistent identities. That verifies the implemented diagnostic labels; it does not validate every horizon and deployment distribution (`L/C1-DECLARED-TARGET-LEARNABILITY-2026-09-10.md:37–42,76–85`). A general information ceiling would require, for example, physically realizable identical-input contexts with conflicting optimal decisions plus their occurrence probabilities and unavoidable regret. A failed fit supplies none of those quantities.
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-strategic-astra-ws/ADJUDICATION-ASTRA-2026-09-10.md:85:The contract's coordinator instead receives a nominal model with **no realised fading** (`C/V025-STAGES-6-8-CONTRACT-v1-2026-09-08.md:7`). Avoiding future-boundary feedback does not repair present realised-information access. These results can support an offline benchmark in that stronger information class. They do not establish attainable nominal-policy headroom, a nominal global ceiling, or deadline-compliant learned efficacy. **UNDETERMINED:** the corresponding nominal-only, fallback-inclusive contrast. It needs a receipt selected under the declared information and timing rules.
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-strategic-astra-ws/ADJUDICATION-ASTRA-2026-09-10.md:95:The ~1% span also belongs to alternative provisioning diagnostics. The eight-anchor receipt gives **+3.618798% for SEALED** and **+0.899421% for STRICT** at 1.66°. Wider-width diagnostics reach +4.022219% even under STRICT; they do not prove a universal 1% ceiling (`B/FINAL-BEAMWIDTH-CURVE-2026-09-10.md:21–29`). SEALED's nominal-power convention is expressly declared in v1.9:5–7. STRICT and MARGIN_Q must remain named alternatives, not silently replace it. The 20-anchor results are +4.6046% SEALED and +1.2913% MARGIN_Q (`H/RESEEDED-SPAN-2026-09-10.md:55–59`). None is a source-training contrast or a global optimum certificate.
