and
[non-anchor agreement test](tests/physics_v025/test_offline_suni_diagnostic.py).

The fixed point is an arbitrary result of this greedy path, **not a ceiling on
unilateral reasoning**.  `FULL > S_UNI_OFFLINE` licenses only “not reproducible
by this greedy path.”  The receipt uses `not_a_unilateral_ceiling` and
`interpretation_limit` fields; it does not contain a ceiling field that could
be mistaken for an upper bound.

