   tolerance;
2. the unilateral arm selects a profile different from the anchor; and
3. the deployed selector selects that same non-anchor profile.

The tolerance is an input to the assertion; no threshold was changed.  The
current degenerate case `interaction = 0`, deployed = `BASE`, unilateral =
`BASE` now fails with:

